# The projection bracket only ever moves DEEPER inside one episode: a deeper
# crossing speaks, wobble inside an announced bracket does not. Reversing the
# comparison silences the deeper crossing (and would re-announce on recovery),
# which is the flapping the episode model exists to absorb (banshee-3sn).
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/episode.rs
test: only_a_deeper_projection_crossing_speaks_again
---OLD---
        (Some(b), Some(prev)) if b < prev => {
---NEW---
        (Some(b), Some(prev)) if b > prev => {
